From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Kopco <hey@oddcelot.dev>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:15:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bun_alloc, mimalloc_sys: allocate through a Rust mimalloc
 shim on wasm

wasm64-unknown-unknown has no C toolchain for mimalloc and an empty libc crate. mimalloc_sys/wasm.rs implements the mi_* symbols on std::alloc, with per-heap block lists so mi_heap_destroy frees every block. bun_alloc mounts wasm_libc.rs as crate::libc for malloc/realloc/free/strlen/max_align_t. 64-bit layout asserts are gated on target_pointer_width.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
